<p class="0" style="line-height: 150%; margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">등록금 고지서 참조</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;">)</span></p></td>
<td style="width: 233px; height: 118px; padding: 1px; border-width: 1px medium 1px 1px; border-style: solid none solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle;">
<p class="0" style="line-height: 150%; margin: 2px 6px 2px 38px; text-indent: -12pt; text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">합격자가 등록 기간 내에 등록금 미납부시 합격을 취소함</span></p>
<p class="0" style="line-height: 150%; margin: 2px 6px 2px 38px; text-indent: -12pt; text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;"><span style="font-family: 돋움;">등록포기 및 등록금 환불 </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;">:  &lsquo;</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">대학등록금에 관한</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">규칙</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;">&rsquo; </span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">및 </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;">&lsquo;</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">부산대학교</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">학칙</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;">&rsquo;</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">에 따라 처리</span></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="width: 108px; height: 143px; padding: 1px; border-width: 1px 1px 2px medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor; background: rgb(230, 238, 247); vertical-align: middle;">
<p class="0" style="line-height: 150%; margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center; word-break: keep-all;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">학위증명 관련</span></p>
<p class="0" style="line-height: 150%; margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center; word-break: keep-all;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">서류 제출</span></p></td>
<td style="width: 37px; height: 143px; padding: 1px; border-width: 1px medium 2px 1px; border-style: solid none solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle;">
<p class="0" style="line-height: 150%; margin-left: 1px; text-align: right; word-break: keep-all; font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;">&nbsp;</p></td>
<td style="width: 135px; height: 143px; padding: 1px; border-width: 1px 1px 2px medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor; vertical-align: middle;">
<p class="0" style="line-height: 150%; margin-right: 2px;"><span style="font-family: 돋움;"></span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;">3. 19.(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">금</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;">)</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">까지</span></p></td>
<td style="width: 161px; height: 143px; padding: 1px; border-width: 1px 1px 2px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle;">
