<p class="0" style="line-height: 150%; margin-left: 6px;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;">부산광역시</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;">금정구</span></p>
<p class="0" style="line-height: 150%; margin-left: 6px;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1.3pt;">부산대학로 </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1.8pt;">63</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1.3pt;">번길 </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1.8pt;">2(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1.3pt;">장전동</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1.8pt;">)</span></p>
<p class="0" style="line-height: 150%; margin-left: 6px;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.9pt;">부산대학교 상남국제관 </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1.4pt;">2</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.9pt;">층 </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1.8pt;">입학과 </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-weight: bold;">일반대학원</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.9pt;"> </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.9pt;">담당자 앞</span></p>
<p class="0" style="line-height: 150%; margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; margin-top: 9px; text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;">방문</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt;">)</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;">상남국제관 </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt;">2</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;">층 입학과</span></p></td>
<td style="width: 233px; height: 143px; padding: 1px; border-width: 1px medium 2px 1px; border-style: solid none solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) currentcolor rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle;">
<p class="0" style="line-height: 130%; margin: 2px 6px 2px 38px; text-indent: -12pt; text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1.4pt;">제출대상자 </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1.9pt;">: </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1.4pt;">외국대학 졸업 최종합격자</span></p>
<p class="0" style="line-height: 100%; margin: 2px 6px 2px 38px; text-indent: -12pt; text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;">기한 내에 반드시 제출하여야 하며</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.9pt;">,</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt;"></span></p>
<p class="0" style="line-height: 110%; margin: 2px 6px 2px 38px; text-indent: -12pt; text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt;"></span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt;">특별한 사유 없이 제출하지 않을 경우</span></p>
<p class="0" style="line-height: 140%; margin: 2px 6px 2px 38px; text-indent: -12pt; text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt;"></span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -1pt;">입학 취소 처리됨</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;">.</span></p>
<p class="0" style="line-height: 150%; margin: 4px 6px 4px 38px; text-indent: -12pt; text-align: left; word-break: keep-all;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;">(p.</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;">17</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;">〔</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">주</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;">4</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;">〕</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">참조</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;">)</span></p></td>
